    {
      "en": ": Good evening, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ": 晚上好，Sensei。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please make no sudden movements or I will call the police.",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ": 请别做突然的肢体动作，否则我就报警。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What kind of person do you think I am?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 你以为我是哪种人？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": The worst kind. But I will still allow you to talk to me as there is a witness in the hall.",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ": 最坏的那种。不过我仍会允许你跟我说话——因为走廊里有目击者在。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...please leave me out of this.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ": 呃……请别把我扯进来。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I spend some time in the hall with Touka, trying to convince her that I am not the scum of the earth.",
      "zh": "我在走廊里陪了 Touka 一会儿，试图让她相信我不是人渣。"
    },
    {
      "en": "It does not work and I go home without making any sort of substantial impact on her life.",
      "zh": "没用。我回了家，没对她的生活造成任何实质影响。"
    },
    {
      "en": "But at least her affection goes up.",
      "zh": "不过至少，她的好感度上升了。"
